       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CSNOTES.
      *****************************************************************
      * CSS COMMON - CALLED SUBPROGRAM.  SEEDS A SERVICE ORDER'S     *
      * TECH-NOTES FIELD WITH A STANDARD HEADER LINE.                *
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-NOTE-HEADER          PIC X(30).
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-CUST-NAME            PIC X(30).
       01  LK-TECH-NOTES          PIC X(60).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-CUST-NAME LK-TECH-NOTES.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE LK-CUST-NAME TO WS-NOTE-HEADER
           STRING 'CUST: '     DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  LK-CUST-NAME DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  ' - NEW SERVICE ORDER' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  INTO LK-TECH-NOTES
           END-STRING
           GOBACK.
